  "published": "2026-08-14T11:42:50.403Z",
  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release. LZ4 and LZMA (+ Unity's own LZMA header variant): full\nencode/decode, verified byte-for-byte in both directions against independent reference implementations\n(lz4js, Python's lzma module). Zstandard: full decoder (frame/block parsing, FSE with predefined or\ncustom tables, Huffman-coded literals, sequence execution), verified against real Zstandard-compressed\ndata including actual Figma-exported .fig files; the encoder currently emits valid standards-compliant\nframes using Raw/RLE blocks only (correct, just not entropy-coded) - full FSE/Huffman encoding is a\nfollow-up. Also includes thin wrappers around System.IO.Compression's own Deflate/Gzip.",
